  "title": "How to Get Compensation After a Car Accident?",
  "excerpt": "A crash in Colorado can disrupt daily life in an instant. Medical bills begin to accumulate, responsibilities at work become harder to keep up with, and insurance companies often push for quick resolutions that don’t reflect the full extent of the harm. Many people reach out to Dormer Harpring wanting to know how to get […]",
  "publishedAt": "2026-01-23T11:28:08",
  "modifiedAt": "2026-02-19T08:52:37",
  "categories": [
    "auto-accident"
  ],
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b40m",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l40j",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s40i",
          "text": "A crash in Colorado can disrupt daily life in an instant. Medical bills begin to accumulate, responsibilities at work become harder to keep up with, and insurance companies often push for quick resolutions that don’t reflect the full extent of the harm. Many people reach out to ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s40k",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring",
          "marks": [
            "l40j"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s40l",
          "text": " wanting to know how to get compensation after a car accident and what steps truly make a difference in the outcome of their claim. The answer isn’t the same for everyone—it depends on how the collision happened, the seriousness of the injuries, how fault is assigned, and the evidence available to support the claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "i40n",
      "src": "./images/2026-01-Man-calls-someone-after-a-car-accident-1024x683.jpg",
      "alt": "How to Get Compensation After a Car Accident?"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b40p",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s40o",
          "text": "Our team focuses on helping people navigate these challenges with clarity and confidence, making sure they understand their rights under Colorado law and the actions that can strengthen their case from the very beginning.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b40r",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s40q",
          "text": "Common Causes of Car Accidents in Colorado",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b40t",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s40s",
          "text": "Car accidents happen for many reasons, and Colorado’s terrain, weather patterns, and traffic conditions often make things worse. The most frequent causes include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b40v",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s40u",
          "text": "Distracted driving—texting, using navigation apps, reaching for objects, or simply taking eyes off the road.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b40x",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s40w",
          "text": "Speeding or reckless driving, especially along highways like I-25, C-470, and I-70.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b40z",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s40y",
          "text": "Driving under the influence of alcohol or drugs.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b411",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s410",
          "text": "Following too closely, which leads to rear-end collisions.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b413",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s412",
          "text": "Sudden weather shifts such as snow, black ice, and heavy rain.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b415",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s414",
          "text": "Faulty brakes, worn-out tires, or poor vehicle maintenance.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b417",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s416",
          "text": "Identifying the cause of the crash is essential because it helps establish negligence, which is the foundation of any compensation claim in Colorado. We often see accidents involving a combination of factors—for example, a driver speeding too fast for icy conditions while looking down at their phone. When multiple causes overlap, a detailed investigation becomes even more important.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b419",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s418",
          "text": "Common Car Accident Injuries",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b41b",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41a",
          "text": "Injuries vary widely from case to case. Some heal quickly with proper treatment; others leave long-term consequences. Among the most common are:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b41d",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41c",
          "text": "Whiplash and other soft-tissue injuries",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b41f",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41e",
          "text": "Broken bones",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b41h",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41g",
          "text": "Back and spinal injuries",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b41j",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41i",
          "text": "Traumatic brain injuries, including concussions",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b41l",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41k",
          "text": "Internal injuries",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b41n",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41m",
          "text": "Emotional and psychological trauma",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b41p",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41o",
          "text": "Colorado compensation laws take into account not just the initial injury but also how it affects daily life, work, mobility, and long-term health. Many people underestimate the seriousness of their injuries early on, only to realize days or weeks later that symptoms have worsened. Prompt medical evaluation protects both your health and your claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b41r",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41q",
          "text": "Car Accident Compensation",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b41w",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l41t",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.law.cornell.edu/wex/damages"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41s",
          "text": "How to get compensation after a car accident? In civil cases, the law provides financial remedies to compensate for ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41u",
          "text": "damages",
          "marks": [
            "l41t"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41v",
          "text": ", helping injured individuals recover. Compensation can include monetary awards for actual losses or punitive damages meant to punish extreme misconduct.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b41y",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41x",
          "text": "For car accident cases in Colorado, compensation depends on the physical, emotional, and financial harm the collision caused. We evaluate every category carefully, gather supporting evidence, and build a strong record that reflects the true impact of the crash. The goal is to ensure the claim reflects not just immediate costs but also long-term needs such as ongoing treatment or future wage losses.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b420",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s41z",
          "text": "Who to Sue After an Accident?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b422",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s421",
          "text": "Liability in a collision is not always limited to one driver. Depending on the facts, the at-fault parties may include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b424",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s423",
          "text": "The negligent driver",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b426",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s425",
          "text": "The vehicle owner",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b428",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s427",
          "text": "A commercial employer, if the driver was working at the time.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b42a",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s429",
          "text": "A manufacturer, if a defective auto part contributed to the crash.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b42c",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s42b",
          "text": "A government entity responsible for roadway maintenance.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b42e",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s42d",
          "text": "Colorado uses a modified comparative negligence system. Then, how can you get compensation after a car accident? Under this rule, you can recover compensation as long as your share of fault is less than the defendant’s. When responsibility is shared, the compensation you receive is reduced by your percentage of fault.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b42g",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s42f",
          "text": "How to Calculate Your Potential Compensation?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b42i",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s42h",
          "text": "Compensation isn’t based on guesswork or a simple formula. Each category of damages requires clear documentation, thorough evaluation, and a consistent narrative showing how the crash changed your life. Typically, damages fall into three groups.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b42k",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s42j",
          "text": "Economic Damages",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b42m",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s42l",
          "text": "Economic damages cover financial losses you can verify with receipts or records, including:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b42o",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s42n",
          "text": "Emergency care, hospitalization, and ongoing medical treatment.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b42q",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s42p",
          "text": "Future medical needs",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b42s",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s42r",
          "text": "Lost wages",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b42u",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s42t",
          "text": "Reduced earning capacity",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b42w",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s42v",
          "text": "Vehicle repairs",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b42y",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s42x",
          "text": "Rehabilitation and therapy",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b430",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s42z",
          "text": "Transportation costs related to medical care",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b432",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s431",
          "text": "These records form the backbone of your claim. When future care is likely, we work with medical and vocational experts to estimate long-term costs so that no expense is overlooked.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b434",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s433",
          "text": "Non-Economic Damages",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b438",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l436",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://colorado.public.law/statutes/crs_13-21-102.5"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s435",
          "text": "Not every impact of a collision is visible on paper. Colorado defines “non-economic loss or injury” as non-pecuniary harm such as pain, suffering, emotional distress, and loss of quality of life under ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s437",
          "text": "C.R.S. § 13-21-102.5.",
          "marks": [
            "l436"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b43a",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s439",
          "text": "These damages often include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b43c",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s43b",
          "text": "Chronic physical pain",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b43e",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s43d",
          "text": "Anxiety, depression, or trauma associated with driving.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b43g",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s43f",
          "text": "Inability to perform daily activities or hobbies.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b43i",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s43h",
          "text": "Loss of enjoyment of life",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b43k",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s43j",
          "text": "These losses are deeply personal and require detailed explanation supported by medical records, personal statements, and expert testimony. Insurance companies tend to undervalue this category, making thorough documentation essential.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b43m",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s43l",
          "text": "Punitive Damages",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b43o",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s43n",
          "text": "Punitive damages are reserved for extreme misconduct—such as driving under the influence at a high level or intentionally disregarding others’ safety. Colorado courts apply this category cautiously and require strong evidence of reckless or intentional behavior. When available, punitive damages can significantly increase the value of a case, but they require clear proof of misconduct.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b43q",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s43p",
          "text": "How to Maximize Your Claim",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b43s",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s43r",
          "text": "Improving the strength of a claim involves strategic decisions from the very beginning. Steps that often improve compensation outcomes include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b43u",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s43t",
          "text": "Getting medical attention immediately and following all treatment recommendations.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b43w",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s43v",
          "text": "Keeping detailed records of every expense.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b43y",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s43x",
          "text": "Tracking symptoms and physical limitations in a journal.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
